<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40648" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίπροσθεν</span></b> , rarely <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίπροσ-θε</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Antiph.
			250
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			<u>SIG</u>
			493.12
		</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), Adv.: <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>. of Place, <i>before</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τίθεσθαι, ποιεῖσθαί τι</span>, put
				<i>before one</i> as a screen, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				468
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				1.4.24
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. γίγνεσθαι</span> to be <i>in
				the way</i>, <i>intercept the view</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Grg.</u>
				523d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ti.</u>
				40c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κώμας καὶ γηλόφους ἐ.
			ποιεῖσθαι</span> take <i>cover behind</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				3.3.28
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. c. gen.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τῶν ὀφθαλμῶν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					213a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς νήσοις οὐδὲν ἐ. τῆς φορᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>Vent.</u>
					30
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐθὺ οὗ ἂν τὸ μέσον ἀμφοῖν τοῖν
					ἐσχάτοιν ἐ. ᾖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prm.</u>
					137e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. of Degree,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῖναί τι ἐ. τινος</span> prefer one
				<i>before</i> another, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				514
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. εἶναί τινος</span> to be
				<i>better</i> than . . , <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Or.</u>
				641
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τᾀσχρὰ . . τῶν
			καλῶν</span> Antiph.l.c.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τι θέσθαι τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					2.4.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γίγνεται ἐ. τοῦ δικαίου τὰ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριακόσια τάλαντα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>BJ</u>
					1.6.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>. of Order,
				<i>first, prior</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐ</span>. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αὐτῶν . . τάξαντες αὐτὰ ἐ. ποιησόμεθα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					783b
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				783c
			</span></i>.</div>
